    "updated_at": "2024-12-02T23:02:19Z",
    "body": "> Other examples might include a \"toast\" that shows up (via `popover=manual`) and has a Close button to dismiss it. That close button would not be click-able, even though the toast might obscure part of the modal dialog.\r\n\r\nThanks to @argyleink, here's a demo of that use case (minus the part where it obscures the dialog): https://codepen.io/argyleink/pen/gbYpNLY/a533152314a2ce88bb6ae830f48e032b\r\n",
