    "updated_at": "2024-12-20T01:27:12Z",
    "body": ">I misspoke a little originally\r\n\r\nbut i got what you were saying @alice, just needed to make absolutely sure :)  thank you\r\n\r\nand with @mfreed7's reply, seems we're on the same page.  Just need to ideally also re-parent the a11 tree for those additional top layer elements into the highest modal block, to mitigate the \"why is there content outside of my _modal_?\" issue.",
