    "body": "> I think that would work if we can show that `aria-details` is sufficient for the relevant tools on each platform to actually find that content.\n\nOk - if you have input on how to verify that, I'd appreciate it!\n\n> If there is already an aria-details relationship between M and each of the TL elements, no further a11y tree changes are necessary. If not, an aria-owns should be added, pointing from M to each of the TLs. I don't know what to do if some TLs are aria-details targets and some aren't.\n\nAlso, if you have feedback on the last question, that'd be helpful.\n\nEssentially, I am comfortable with the proposed changes, steps 1 and 2. Step 3 needs an a11y expert that isn't me.",
