    "created_at": "2025-04-11T00:33:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-11T00:33:42Z",
    "body": "To verify, as a conceptual check you could take something like https://codepen.io/sundress/pen/dPyBQMP (the \"debug view\" which I don't think I can link to directly) and check with the relevant screen readers (I believe at least JAWS and possibly NVDA?) that the \"popover\" which is non-inert but outside the dialog is accessible.\n\nIf Chrome still has its incredible accessibility QA team, they should be able to help with that.\n\nThen, once it's been prototyped in the browser as you propose, they could double check that it still WAI.",
